// 測試專用 wrangler 設定：main 直接指向原始碼，讓 TDD 不需重建 dist
// 正式部署仍使用 wrangler.jsonc（main=dist/worker/index.js）
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "worker-ssh-test",
  "main": "src/worker/index.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-08-01",
  "kv_namespaces": [
    { "binding": "KV", "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KV_NAMESPACE_ID" }
  ],
  "d1_databases": [
    {
      "binding": "DB",
      "database_name": "worker-ssh-test",
      "database_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "preview_database_id": "worker-ssh-vitest"
    }
  ],
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [
      { "name": "SSH_SESSIONS", "class_name": "SshSessionObject" },
      { "name": "SSH_QUOTA", "class_name": "SshQuotaObject" }
    ]
  },
  "migrations": [
    { "tag": "v1", "new_sqlite_classes": ["SshSessionObject"] },
    { "tag": "v2", "new_sqlite_classes": ["SshQuotaObject"] }
  ],
  "assets": {
    "directory": "test/fixtures/assets",
    "binding": "ASSETS"
  }
}
